<!-- ═══════════════ TEXT 1 ═══════════════ -->
<div class="ex-text align-right">
  <p>Caelis Galería is delighted to present "Reach Out," a solo exhibition by Spanish artist Jaime Sancorlo. Born in Madrid in 1980, Sancorlo primarily focuses on exploring texture and expressing color. Drawing inspiration from historical black-and-white photographs from difficult periods, he injects a playful and witty touch of cartoon characters to create a juxtaposition of surreal, pop, and ironic elements.</p>
</div>

