<!-- ═══════════════ TEXT 4 ═══════════════ -->
<div class="ex-text align-right">
  <p>Behind the layers of historical fragments, Jaime Sancorlo pays tribute to the meticulous detailing of hyperrealism. At first glance, his artworks usually present an aged and somber black-and-white color palette. Yet, beneath the surface, the coarse texture and sharp edges reveal a transformative process of selective treatment, transcending mere reproduction to become an embodiment of carefully chosen authenticity.</p>
</div>

